  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian action through volunteers, enablers and networks (HAVEN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Working with a consortium led by Nonviolent Peaceforce International (NP) to promote civilian protection through: support to frontline volunteer groups, promoting International Humanitarian Law and norms, piloting and running area-based coordination mechanisms and supporting humanitarian data collection to facilitate an effective humanitarian response in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
